Cell["\<\
The covering number falls with the radius and reaches 1 at the radius of the \
graph, 9 on the grid and 6 on the mesh:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"7eae97ee-c9ba-405a-9a1d-5a768361e876"],

